# Enforce LF line endings for all text files on checkout, regardless of platform.
# Without this, a Windows runner's `git checkout` (autocrlf) converts LF -> CRLF on
# disk, and `biome ci` (configured `formatter.lineEnding: "lf"`) then reports every
# file as "content differs from formatting output", failing the Windows CI gate.
# git auto-detects binary files and leaves them untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
